One iota group whose type declares no conversion method, whose values no
conversion produces and which no decoder writes, with one member named by nothing.
That member is a candidate of the sweep, which is what the class exists not to
retain.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/enumplain

go 1.27.1
-- mode.go --
package enumplain

// Mode is the enumerated type, and every value of it is named in the source.
type Mode int

const (
	ModeRead Mode = iota
	ModeWrite
)

// Use names one member, and nothing names the other.
func Use() Mode { return ModeRead }
